ORGANIZER;CN=Platform Engineering:mailto:sre@flyfleet.com
DESCRIPTION:Second quarterly tabletop drill. Scenario: API Complete Outage (SEV1).\n\nThis drills fast-paced decision making under pressure.\n\nParticipants: All on-call engineers (required)\nPre-read: Will be provided 1 week prior\n\nFocus areas:\n- SEV1 declaration within 5 min\n- War room setup efficiency\n- Runbook adherence\n- Communication cadence\n- PIR completion\n\nLocation: Zoom - link in description
SUMMARY:Incident Response Drill #2 - API Outage (SEV1)
LOCATION:Zoom - https://zoom.us/j/FlyFleetDrill2
CATEGORIES:DRILL,TRAINING
END:VEVENT

