ORGANIZER;CN=Platform Engineering:mailto:sre@flyfleet.com
DESCRIPTION:Quarterly tabletop drill #3. Scenario: Security Incident (Data Breach).\n\nDrill focuses on:\n- Legal/Compliance escalation\n- Evidence preservation\n- Customer notification timing\n- Coordination with Security Officer\n\nPre-read: Security Incident runbook + GDPR requirements\n\nRequired: ICs, Security team, Legal liaison, VP Eng\n\nLocation: Zoom
SUMMARY:Incident Response Drill #3 - Security Incident
LOCATION:Zoom - https://zoom.us/j/FlyFleetDrill3
CATEGORIES:DRILL,SECURITY
