DESCRIPTION:Incident Commander Certification Training\n\nFor senior engineers aspiring to be ICs.\n\nAdvanced topics:\n- Command & control under pressure\n- Decision-making frameworks\n- Stakeholder communication (executives, legal)\n- Crisis management\n- PIR facilitation\n- Blameless culture\n\nIncludes: 1-hour tabletop simulation with evaluation\n\nPrerequisite: 6 months on-call experience, attended IR training\n\nAssessment: Scenario-based evaluation, pass/fail\n\nLocation: Conference Room A
SUMMARY:IC Certification Training
